# sent_id = HV24.287_Joseph_Makaʻai_LSnakenberg_19820218_6
# text = A mahalo nō hoʻi ko ʻoukou hoʻolohe hou mai iā mākou kēia ahiahi, he mau mea hou nō hoʻi kā mākou e hōʻike aku ai, akā, ma mua nō o nā nūhou e hoʻolaha aku iā ʻoukou, he mau manaʻo mahalo nō hoʻi ko māua me koʻu ʻanakala, ʻo ia ʻo Iokepa Makaʻai e hāʻawi ai i ka poʻe a pau i ka mokupuni o Kauaʻi, a no ka mea, i laila aku nei nō māua no ka male ʻana o Pua Nicholas Nīʻau a iā, i kāna kāne hou, iā Joseph Lee.
